*PageRegion w162h90/2.25x1.25 Address Label: "<</PageSize[162 90]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w216h72/3x1 Barcode Label: "<</PageSize[216 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w144h72/2x1 Label: "<</PageSize[144 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w288h432
*ImageableArea w288h432/4x6 Shipping Label: "0 0 288 432"
*ImageableArea w288h288/4x4 Label: "0 0 288 288"
*ImageableArea w162h90/2.25x1.25 Address Label: "0 0 162 90"
*ImageableArea w216h72/3x1 Barcode Label: "0 0 216 72"
*ImageableArea w144h72/2x1 Label: "0 0 144 72"

*DefaultPaperDimension: w288h432
